# .dockerignore — hermetic docker build contexts (Phase 16).
#
# Whitelist approach: exclude EVERYTHING by default, then re-include only the
# paths the images need. This keeps contexts tiny (source only — never the
# multi-GB Bazel execroot, cargo target/, node_modules, .next, infra state or
# local tool caches) so image layers are reproducible and transfers are fast.
# The enclave image builds with context ./enclave and the frontend image with
# root context — this file applies to the root-context build (frontend).

# Exclude everything by default.
*

# --- Frontend image (root context: `docker build -f frontend/Dockerfile .`)
# Workspace manifests + lockfile first (pnpm needs them to resolve deps).
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
# Workspace member manifests (needed for a full frozen install).
!blockchain/
!blockchain/package.json
!frontend/
!frontend/**

# --- Exclusions within the re-included paths -----------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/.vercel/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
